json/scalar
description: Atomic value that nests nothing
- >
  A **scalar** is an atomic value — it nests nothing further. JSON has exactly four scalar kinds:
- !!<format: text/x-json> |
  "text"   42   true   null
- >
  See the subchapters below for each kind:
- *: 00-json_string
- *: 01-json_number
- *: 02-json_boolean
- *: 03-json_null
